(7, 6, 4, 1, '7', 2, '2020-02-02', 1, 0, 0, NULL, '   20   ', '35', 'Unassigned', '7', 0, 'M6', 0, '', '20S0003456', '20VP7', 2, '? BCC left back skin excision, ? BCC right back', 'A. Skin excision- left back ? BCC\nB. Skin punch biopsy right back ? BCC', 'A. Ellipse of skin 32 x 14mm with 3mm of underlying adipose tissue. A nodular lesion is seen 9mm which appears excised. Margins inked with black ink\nB. A 4mm ounch biopsy of white skin'),
